title: "Lightweight residual fusion reveals temporal generalization limits in scientific visual question answering"
version: 1.0.0
type: software
abstract: "Reproducibility code and aggregate source data for an option-shared residual scorer over frozen CLIP and BiomedCLIP representations for scientific visual question answering on PMC-VQA, including grouped validation, data-scaling analyses, and post-cutoff temporal evaluation."
